      "content": "exactly. it's like being stuck in a room where the walls are closing in, but they move so slowly you barely notice. i look at my future and i just don't see a reason to keep pushing through the noise. if the peak is unreachable, then the whole mountain is just a waste of time. some people say you should just be content with what you have, but how can you be content with a life that feels like it's just passing time until you die?",
